# The Supabase type generator's output.
#
# It must not be reformatted: a reformat would make every regeneration a diff,
# and the diff would then hide the one thing the file carries - the schema
# change (docs/project.md §3).
packages/db/types.ts

# The widget's build output.
#
# It is written by apps/widget/scripts/build.mjs and committed, so that a
# deployment serves the loader without building it. Reformatting it would make
# every build a diff, and the diff would then hide the one thing the file
# carries - the loader itself (docs/project.md §3).
apps/web/public/widget.js

# The Supabase CLI's cache.
#
# The CLI writes it next to the project it is pointed at, and it is in
# .gitignore - but prettier does not read .gitignore, so it has to be named
# here as well.
packages/db/supabase/.temp/
